{"unit_id":"superqin7__dsh-tr-bridge#card-zh","repo":"superqin7/dsh-tr-bridge","commit":"b6fdd462d8be483e0ea9f5013d94dfe256f56310","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tr-bridge 是一个面向 DSH 桌面端的 TokenRouter CLI 桥接插件。它通过 DSH 工具接口接收任务，并调用本机已有的 tr 命令，将任务交给 Codex 或 Grok。用户可以先预览启动参数、并行派发独立任务、等待文本回复，也可以取消调用；插件会限制任务与输出长度，并处理超时和命令错误。Codex 命令使用 read-only 沙箱，Grok 调用附带禁止修改文件的提示。适合希望在 DSH 会话中调用现有 TokenRouter CLI 的用户；需要本机已安装并登录配置相应 CLI。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:97-147","index.js:16-27","index.js:56-95"]}
{"unit_id":"superqin7__dsh-tr-bridge#card-en","repo":"superqin7/dsh-tr-bridge","commit":"b6fdd462d8be483e0ea9f5013d94dfe256f56310","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tr-bridge sends DSH session tasks through the local TokenRouter CLI to Codex or Grok. It supports argument preview, concurrent calls, cancellation, timeouts, and bounded output. Codex uses a read-only sandbox argument; Grok receives a no-write instruction. Requires the relevant CLI locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:97-147","index.js:16-27","index.js:56-95"]}
