{"unit_id":"superqin7__dsh-tr-bridge#feature-1","repo":"superqin7/dsh-tr-bridge","commit":"b6fdd462d8be483e0ea9f5013d94dfe256f56310","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tr-bridge 的功能「派发 Codex 或 Grok 任务」：DSH 工具接收代理名和任务文本，并通过本机 tr CLI 启动对应命令；Codex 参数包含只读沙箱，Grok 任务前会附加禁止修改文件的文字提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:16-27","index.js:105-147"]}
{"unit_id":"superqin7__dsh-tr-bridge#feature-2","repo":"superqin7/dsh-tr-bridge","commit":"b6fdd462d8be483e0ea9f5013d94dfe256f56310","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tr-bridge 的功能「预览调用参数」：调用工具时设置 dryRun=true，只显示工作目录和隐藏任务正文后的命令参数预览，不启动子进程。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:126-135"]}
{"unit_id":"superqin7__dsh-tr-bridge#feature-3","repo":"superqin7/dsh-tr-bridge","commit":"b6fdd462d8be483e0ea9f5013d94dfe256f56310","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tr-bridge 的功能「取消与限制调用」：外部命令运行时响应 DSH 取消信号，并设有超时；输入任务最多 20,000 字符，返回内容最多约 24,000 字符，过长结果会截断。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:9-11","index.js:56-95","index.js:137"]}
